intent = 'Equal per-camp cap per round: camp1 total 2 timber (6 when stock >= 90%), camps 2-5 total 4 each. Anything harvested above the cap goes to the reserve. Same for everyone, no exemptions, no new powers. Sunsets after 3 consecutive rounds with all camps at 90%+.'

